# Results and reports are provenance, not editable text.
#
# A run's "inputs digest" is a SHA-256 over the bytes of its result JSON. Git's
# line-ending conversion rewrites those bytes on checkout (on Windows, with
# core.autocrlf=true), so identical measurements hash differently after a clone, a
# new worktree or a branch switch. Pinning LF keeps a digest meaning what the
# reports say it means.
#
# Study 01 pins its own v3 runs in studies/01-charity-tree/.gitattributes, which was
# deliberately scoped so that historical runs' bytes are not rewritten without an
# audit. These rules cover studies 02 and 03, whose runs were produced with LF.
studies/02-ticket-booking/results/**/*.json text eol=lf
studies/02-ticket-booking/reports/**/*.md text eol=lf
studies/03-reserved-seating/results/**/*.json text eol=lf
studies/03-reserved-seating/reports/**/*.md text eol=lf

# AI work records and book sources are hashed and consumed across Windows and WSL.
docs/ai-work/** text eol=lf
book/** text eol=lf

# The book PDF is a binary artefact whose sha256 is recorded in its manifest.
# It must be stored byte-for-byte; text/eol conversion would break the hash.
book/dist/**/*.pdf -text

# Root status documents are edited from both sides (Windows editors write CRLF),
# and a CRLF working copy differs from an LF blob in every line. On 2026-09-29 the
# main checkout read as "both files modified" with zero content difference
# (`git diff --ignore-cr-at-eol` empty), which would have blocked a fast-forward
# merge of an unrelated change. Pinning LF makes the comparison byte-stable, as the
# results and reports rules above do for digests.
/CONTEXT.md text eol=lf
/LESSONS_LEARNED.md text eol=lf

# Canonical book orchestration and figure hashes must survive Windows checkout.
infra/*.sh text eol=lf
infra/versions.env text eol=lf
**/*.puml text eol=lf

# Owner-authorized cleanup archive: preserve loose files exactly as captured.
docs/book-release-20261004/archive/** -text
studies/01-charity-tree/results/20261001T143404Z-t1/** -text
studies/01-charity-tree/results/20261001T143627Z-t1/** -text
